{
    "title": "Weather Forecast",
    "description": "The weather forecast, one of the best weather app, is free to provide accurate daily weather and even hourly forecasts, severe weather alerts, daily weather updates, storm forecasts, weather widgets, weather radar, and global weather! \ud83d\udef0 \ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udf2a\r\n\r\n Information about local weather forecasts, real-time temperature, storm, rainfall, snow, humidity, wind force, and wind direction is all in this weather app! \u2600\ufe0f \ud83c\udf24 \u26c5\ufe0f \r\n\r\nWeather Forecast detects weather in your current location automatically. There are many information in it, which includes weather condition, relative humidity, visibility distance, precipitation in different unites, dew point, wind speed and direction, weather report for the next 14 days as well as hourly weather forecast! \ud83d\udca7 \ud83d\udca6 \u2614\ufe0f\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf26 Weather forecast features\r\n-Provide Weather forecast for global. All are free with hourly, weekly, daily, update in real-time\r\n- Show today's weather, tomorrow's weather, the next 14 days' weather and will update each hour\r\n- Localize to most of the world languages\r\n- Add and track the weather conditions in multiple locations\r\n- Show air quality, including index of PM 2.5, PM 10, SO2, NO2, O3, CO\r\n- Satellite image & Weather radar\r\n- Predict the next 14 days' rainfalls\r\n- Tell the time of sunset and sunrise \r\n- Arrange real-time update widget with trendy-design(continue to update more)\r\n- Demonstrate Daily Life Index\r\n- Provide severe weather alerts & storm forecast\r\n- Permit or forbid the notifications\r\n- Show chart graphs for hourly and daily weather forecast, probability of rainfall, condition of wind and air quality\r\n- Enjoy weather widget and ongoing notification, multiple locations on the widget\r\n- Update various weather information: Real feel temperature, wet bulb temperature, wind direction, wind speed, gust, ultraviolet level and intensity, humidity, dew point, precipitation, visibility, cloud cover, sunrise, sunset\r\n- Show weather information of past 24 hour: precipitation, max & min temperature\r\n- Weather supports geo-positioning, retrieving the latest weather conditions for your current location (Automatic location detection by network and GPS)\r\n- Change unit setting: Temperature (\u2103/\u2109), Time format (12h/24h), Precipitation (mm, cm), wind speed (km/h, mi/h, m/s), visibility(miles, km) \r\n- 3 theme styles for your choice\r\n- Heating and cooling remind: set the temperature to suit yourself\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf2a Severe weather alerts\r\nThis weather app can also be turned into a global weather tracker and it can send you severe weather alerts to help you get prepared for upcoming weather changes, like stormy weather, heatwave, thunderstorm, heavy rainfall and so on. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0f Weather forecast for global, for all countries\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf06 Weather forecast for all cities\r\n\r\nThe weather forecast is very helpful for everybody. If you know weather information, You can prepare your plan carefully, which is beneficial to both your work and daily life. \u2744\ufe0f \u2603\ufe0f \u26c4\ufe0f\r\n\r\nCome and download this most accurate free weather forecast app, it will become your personal weather station!",
